<title>PAKISTAN: Pakistan soyoil imports double in Jan-April -trade.</title>
<headline>Pakistan soyoil imports double in Jan-April -trade.</headline>
<dateline>KARACHI, Pakistan 1997-04-30</dateline>
<text>
<p>Pakistan's soyoil imports almost doubled to 110,962 tonnes in January-April from 55,860 tonnes in the same year-ago period, vegetable oil traders said on Wednesday.</p>
<p>Palm oil imports fell 19 percent to 287,692 tonnes in the same period from 354,583 tonnes a year earlier, a dealer at Saulat Enterprises said.</p>
<p>Imports of sunflower oil fell 31 percent to 1,500 tonnes from 2,200 tonnes a year earlier. --Karachi newsroom 9221-5685192</p>
